#. module: letsencrypt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:letsencrypt.field_base_config_settings_letsencrypt_dns_provider
msgid ""
"For wildcard certificates we need to add a TXT record on your DNS. If you set "
"this to \"Shell script\" you can enter a shell script. Other options can be added by installing additional modules."
msgstr ""
"Per i certificati multi-sito occorre aggiungere un record TXT nel DNS. "
"Impostare questo in \"Shell script\" per attivare un comando shell. Alter opzioni richiedono moduli aggiuntiti."

